<title>USA: Miami Subs names Boulis interim CEO.</title>
<headline>Miami Subs names Boulis interim CEO.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Miami Subs Corp Friday said Thomas Russo resigned as chairman, president and chief executive officer.  Gus Boulis, founder, board member and Miami Subs' largest shareholder, was named interim CEO and chairman.</p>
<p>Russo said he will be pursuing other interests.</p>
<p>Miami Subs operates restaurants under the names &quot;Miami Subs&quot; and &quot;Miami Subs Grill.&quot;</p>
